@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Supported currency/network combinations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chains

### Capture one observation (consumes one or more provider attempts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chains/btc/main/snapshots

### Read stored history without contacting the provider
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chains/btc/main/snapshots?pageSize=20

### Read a stored observation (replace the ID with one returned by POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chains/btc/main/snapshots/1

### Capture all five sources (consumes at least five provider attempts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot-collections

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database/schema readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
